<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech legislators vote on 1995 budget surplus.</title>
<headline>Czech legislators vote on 1995 budget surplus.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech parliament voted on Wednesday to put 5.5 billion crowns of the 7.2 billion 1995 state budget surplus into state reserves, the local agency CTK said.</p>
<p>It added that further 1.7 billion would be used to strenghten the reserves for the state health insurance system.</p>
</text>
